From: Andrew Branson <andrew.branson@jolla.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 18:34:42 +0200
Subject: [bluezqt] Initialise existing batteries in QML devices. JB#61542

Populate the battery wrapper when a declarative device is created, so a
battery discovered before the QML consumer is constructed is immediately
available without waiting for a later battery change notification.

---
 src/imports/declarativedevice.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/imports/declarativedevice.cpp b/src/imports/declarativedevice.cpp
index cb524ef..23432ee 100644
--- a/src/imports/declarativedevice.cpp
+++ b/src/imports/declarativedevice.cpp
@@ -47,6 +47,7 @@ DeclarativeDevice::DeclarativeDevice(BluezQt::DevicePtr device, DeclarativeAdapt
         Q_EMIT deviceChanged(this);
     });
 
+    updateBattery();
     updateInput();
     updateMediaPlayer();
 }
